{# 
  Affidavit in Reply — Jinja2 Template (Default: Bombay High Court Format)
  
  This template follows the 10-part skeleton defined in the format guide.
  All fixed legal phrases are preserved exactly as specified.
  
  Variables come from the CaseEntities Pydantic model.
#}
IN THE HIGH COURT OF JUDICATURE AT {{ forum_city }}

{{ clean_jurisdiction }}

{{ case_type }} NO. {{ case_number }} OF {{ year }}

{{ petitioner.name }}{% if petitioner.description %}, {{ petitioner.description.rstrip('.') }}{% endif %}{% if petitioner.clean_address and petitioner.clean_address not in (petitioner.description or '') %}, having registered office at {{ petitioner.clean_address }}{% endif %}

{% if petitioner.clean_through %}
{{ petitioner.clean_through }}.
{% endif %}
...Petitioner

VERSUS

{% for respondent in respondents %}
{{ respondent.respondent_number }}. {{ respondent.name.rstrip('.') }}{% if respondent.description %}, {{ respondent.description.rstrip('.') }}{% endif %}{% if respondent.clean_through %}, {{ respondent.clean_through }}{% endif %}{% if respondent.clean_address and respondent.clean_address not in (respondent.description or '') %}, {% if respondent.is_organisation %}having office at{% else %}residing at{% endif %} {{ respondent.clean_address }}{% endif %}.
...Respondent No.{{ respondent.respondent_number }}
{% endfor %}

AFFIDAVIT IN REPLY ON BEHALF OF RESPONDENT NO. {{ filing_respondent_number }}

{% if deponent.is_organisation_representative %}I, {{ deponent.name }}, having office at {{ deponent.clean_address }}, the {{ deponent.designation }} of the Respondent No.{{ filing_respondent_number }} above named, do hereby {{ deponent.verification_verb }} and state as under:{% else %}I, {{ deponent.name }}, {% if deponent.age %}Age {{ deponent.age.rstrip('.') }}, {% endif %}{% if deponent.occupation %}Occupation: {{ deponent.occupation.rstrip('.') }}, {% endif %}residing at {{ deponent.clean_address }}, the Respondent No.{{ filing_respondent_number }} above named, do hereby {{ deponent.verification_verb }} and state as under:{% endif %}

{% for point in formatted_points %}
{{ point.point_number }}. {{ point.text }}

{% endfor %}

PRAYER

I therefore respectfully pray that this Hon'ble Court may be pleased to:
{% for prayer in clean_prayer_points %}
({{ "abcdefghij"[loop.index0] }}) {{ prayer.rstrip('.;') }};{% if not loop.last %} and{% endif %}

{% endfor %}

{{ jurat_verb }} at {{ attestation_place }}
On this {{ ordinal_date }}

DEPONENT

Before Me

VERIFICATION

I, {{ deponent.name }}, the Deponent above named, do hereby verify that the contents of paragraphs 1 to {{ paragraph_count }} and the Prayer above are true and correct to my knowledge and belief and that nothing material has been concealed therefrom.

Verified at {{ attestation_place }} on this {{ ordinal_date }}.

DEPONENT
{% if advocate_firm %}

{{ advocate_firm }}
